# Save slot 1 from the running GB/GBC game, load it back (ss_rt_gbx.spec).
+600 menu
+12 press DOWN
+2 press CROSS
+12 press SQUARE
+2 dump saved1
+12 dump saved1-dwell
+2 press CIRCLE
+6 press CIRCLE
+60 dump A
+2 menu
+12 press DOWN
+2 press CROSS
+12 press CROSS
+4 press CROSS
+60 dump B
+30 exit 0
